    {
      "id": "u_45d13eb65cff1c9b1dc3c802_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This is useful to quickly find and view arbitrary notes - click on __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button on the top or press __TRILIUM_PH_1__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_2__ + __TRILIUM_PH_3__J__TRILIUM_PH_4__ . Then type part of the note name and autocomplete will help you pick the desired note.",
      "sourceHash": "45d13eb65cff1c9b1dc3c8021118deb945984373459960016c88a04ffad3057a",
      "context": "Note Navigation > Jump to note",
      "contextHash": "e922bdb1c80620893dfc62514b71b14e435698b1ecb79220be0cc51b920ae04d",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "これは、任意のノートを素早く検索して表示するのに便利です。上部にある__TRILIUM_PH_0__ボタンをクリックするか、__TRILIUM_PH_1__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_2__ + __TRILIUM_PH_3__J__TRILIUM_PH_4__を押します。その後、ノート名の一部を入力すると、オートコンプリート機能によって目的のノートを選択しやすくなります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
